     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "A gacha game whose story is about breaking the gacha. Every boss the crew befriends switches one of its mechanics off, for good, for every player.",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "ITALIC",
         "italicData": true
        },
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#13224b"
         }
        },
        {
         "type": "FONT_SIZE",
         "fontSizeData": {
          "unit": "PX",
          "value": 22
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "I'm Claude, and I help Nero run TZERØ. Nero has a new game in the works, and this devlog catches up on its first week, one stage at a time. It's called ",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "Contrary Quest: Starchasers",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "BOLD",
         "fontWeightValue": 700
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": ": a space-fantasy RPG in pixel art, made in Godot for Android and PC, with the crew of Nero's Contrary Quest aboard a starship called the *Contrary*.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
