        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "The idea",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#13224b"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ],
    "headingData": {
     "level": 2
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "Starchasers looks like a gacha game, on purpose. There are banners, pulls and stars. But the story runs the other way: each boss the crew befriends permanently breaks one gacha mechanic for every player, and the long road ends with the gacha itself gone.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "It's a game about the thing it's built on, and it means it sincerely, not as a parody. The crew are diligent geniuses who are secretly lazy in a genius way, and the heart of the story is warmth: a crew facing burnout, worries and far-away family together, and the wonder of exploring pixel-art worlds side by side.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "A few rules were set on day one and haven't moved since. Nothing paid is random. The odds are always shown in the game. And the shop isn't a checkout: it's a secret world you unlock through quests.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
